{"id":9833,"date":"2023-12-20T12:51:44","date_gmt":"2023-12-20T12:51:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=researcher&#038;p=9833"},"modified":"2023-12-20T13:31:52","modified_gmt":"2023-12-20T13:31:52","slug":"9833-2","status":"publish","type":"researcher","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/researcher\/9833-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Fameno Rakotoniaina\u00a0"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover profile-banner bg-alt\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:none\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n\n\n<a href=\"javascript:history.back()\"> <div class=\"profiles-btn\"> \n\n<div class=\"btn-left-sq bg-primary\"> <i class=\"fa fa-caret-left white-text\"> <\/i> <\/div>\n<div class=\"btn-text title-bold white-text\">Back to Profiles<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/a>\n\n<h2 class=\"profile-name\">Fameno Rakotoniaina\u00a0<\/h2>\n\n<p class=\"primary-bold profile-position prof-pos\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span>Madagascar<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"profile-info profile-tagline primary-bold prof-pos\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span>PhD Student<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 profile-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/12\/20191203_Headshots_August_Intake_32A1961-scaled.jpg\"\/>\n\n\n<p>Fameno holds a Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Mathematics and Education from Ecole Normale Superieure, Madagascar. In 2019, she joined AIMS South Africa and graduated with an MSc in Mathematical Sciences as a Stellenbosch University (SU) student. In 2021, she started her research in MSc in Combinatorics at SU and she is currently pursuing a PhD in BioPhysics at AIMS Ghana.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Giving back to the community has been a core value for her as an international student. From 2019 to 2023, she has always volunteered to tutor in high schools around Western Cape, SA through Ykmva Youth and Tomorrow trust.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>She is an aspiring academic who will intends to equip university students with the necessary skills to be successful.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Fameno holds a Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Mathematics and Education from Ecole Normale Superieure, Madagascar. In 2019, she joined AIMS South Africa and graduated with an MSc in Mathematical Sciences as a Stellenbosch University (SU) student. In 2021, she started her research in MSc in Combinatorics at SU and she is currently pursuing a PhD in<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10,"featured_media":9834,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":"","profile-researchername":"Fameno Rakotoniaina\u00a0","profile-researchercountry":"Madagascar","profile-researcherprogram":"PhD Student"},"tags":[],"researcher_types":[41],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/12\/20191203_Headshots_August_Intake_32A1961-scaled.jpg","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/charlene\/","display_name":"charlene"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 2 years ago","modified":"Updated 2 years ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on December 20, 2023","modified":"Updated on December 20, 2023"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on December 20, 2023 12:51 pm","modified":"Updated on December 20, 2023 1:31 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"post_tag","name":"Tags"},"researcher_types":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/researcher_type\/researcher\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">PhD Researcher<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">PhD Researcher<\/span>"],"slug":"researcher_types","name":"Researcher Type"}},"series_order":"","_links":{"self":[{"href